@ModularMonolithHost_HostAddress = http://localhost:5227

### Host health check
GET {{ModularMonolithHost_HostAddress}}/health

### Worker process status
GET {{ModularMonolithHost_HostAddress}}/modules

### Display the default grid page (inspect X-Cache for MISS/HIT)
GET {{ModularMonolithHost_HostAddress}}/

### Display a radial grid page
GET {{ModularMonolithHost_HostAddress}}/?pattern=Radial&size=8

### Get standalone SVG (first request should miss; repeat to observe a cache hit)
GET {{ModularMonolithHost_HostAddress}}/grid.svg?pattern=Checkerboard&size=6

### Get standalone SVG with a normalized fallback pattern and bounded size
GET {{ModularMonolithHost_HostAddress}}/grid.svg?pattern=unknown&size=99
